        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 11:10",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And an amnor of silver was as great as two senums.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 11:11",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And an ezrom of silver was as great as four senums.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 11:12",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And an onti was as great as them all.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 11:13",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Now this is the value of the lesser numbers of their reckoning—",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 11:14",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "A shiblon is half of a senum; therefore, a shiblon for half a measure of barley.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 11:15",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And a shiblum is a half of a shiblon.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 11:16",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
