        "reference": "Alma 11:24",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "And now thou hast lied before God unto me. Thou saidst unto me—Behold these six onties, which are of great worth, I will give unto thee—when thou hadst it in thy heart to retain them from me; and it was only thy desire that I should deny the true and living God, that thou mightest have cause to destroy me. And now behold, for this great evil thou shalt have thy reward.",
